Subject: virtio-fs: track guest cache activity, directories, and one-shot wake hooks

Extend `GuestCache` and `GuestCacheView` with:
- an `activity` counter incremented on lookups, negative lookups (when
  `negative_timeout` is non-zero), directory reads, and inode retargets,
  leaving `init`/`destroy` quiet so idle shares stay dormant;
- a `dir_seq` counter incremented whenever a directory inode is added,
  evicted, or re-anchored, plus `GuestCacheView::dirs()` to snapshot
  currently cached directories;
- one-shot `arm_activity`/`arm_dir_change` wake hooks with `SeqCst`
  barriers so host cache watchers can sleep with no active FSEvents
  stream while a share is idle and drop FSEvents exclusions immediately
  when the guest looks up an excluded directory.

